ans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">本公司致力于保护用户和客户的隐私。您为完成服务所需提供的个人数据，以及通过浏览和/或使用本网站获得的数据，将按我们的 <strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);line-height:normal;\">隐私与 Cookie 政策</strong> 的规定进行处理。</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, arial, verdana, tahoma, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 16px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">本公司已采取适当的技术与组织措施，以确保所处理个人数据的保密性、完整性、可用性与安全性。</p><h2 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, arial, verdana, tahoma, sans-serif;font-size:36px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:-0.032px;line-height:1.112;margin:0px 0px 30px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);line-height:normal;\">管辖与适用法律</strong></h2><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, arial, verdana, tahoma, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;margin:0px 0px 16px;orphans:2;padding:0px;text-align